data: {"id": "7566f8c019a14297-thinking-parallel_evidence-1431", "run_id": "7566f8c019a14297", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 补证结果\n\n**execute_pod_promql 已成功重拨。**\n\n- **namespace** 已补全为 `aiops-case-v17`。\n- **指标结果**：`kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 返回 1 条 series，标签 `container=\"app\"`, `reason=\"Error\"`。\n- **含义**：app 容器最后一次终止原因为 `Error`，而非 `OOMKilled`。这表明容器退出时不是被 OOM Kill 触发，而是以非零退出码退出（Error）。\n\n这与 CrashLoopBackOff 候选原因相关，但 **排除了 OOM Kill 作为直接原因**。需继续查看 Pod events、logs 以确认具体崩溃原因。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789392283136, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "7566f8c019a14297-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "7566f8c019a14297", "seq": 1432, "ts_ms": 1789392293370, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 141.956, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 0, "inconclusive_count": 1, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v17", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "inconclusive", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/7566f8c019a14297-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "dba1f5a5192f24bb4b399599b1c5779a71bc3aad207536e381c3c84d3cd811e0", "bytes": 2423}, "snapshot_sha256": "b76db570225be9a6d9df2b3324724881540e27562802d0568055b8c275820da8"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

