本原因是 OOM 还是配置偏差。\n\n1.  **关于探针超时（高度可信）**：Tracing 和 Logging 明确显示，`/health` 接口实际耗时约 3 秒，这导致 Liveness Probe 发生 `context deadline exceeded`（事实 2, 6, 7）。这是导致容器被周期性重启的直接机制。\n2.  **关于异常根因（冲突/未确认）**：容器退出码为 137（事实 3）。在 Linux 标准中，137 通常意味着进程收到了 Signal 9 (SIGKILL)，常见原因为 OOMKilled 或人为 `kill -9`。然而，K8s State（事实 3）和 Prometheus Metric（事实 5）均明确记录 `terminated_reason=Error`，而非 `OOMKilled`。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实**：\n要区分是 OOM 还是非预期 Kill，需要查看具体的 `container_last_terminated_exit_code` 以及是否存在伴随 `Terminating` 阶段的其他错误日志或 `systemd`/`dmesg` 层面的 OOM 记录。目前的证据在“超时导致被杀”与“被杀的原因记录”之间存在事实冲突，无法直接下结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 142.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v17/workload: 142.0s (Evidence 131.9s, RCA 9.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v17/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 175.301, "metrics": {"run_id": "7566f8c019a14297", "mttr": {"value": "2.9m", "seconds": 175.3088231086731, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}